{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8xOTk5LS1CZWZvcmUvTmFycm93JTIwTWFyZ2luJTIwJTI4MTk5MCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Narrow Margin","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/2qUkMhyBzLbGxng4dMDXGTHntC.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w05q78LmawRoGRZtWnQhBKw2mHl.jpg","description":"An L.A. District Attorney attempts to take an unwilling murder witness back to the United States to testify against a top-level mob boss. Frantically attempting to escape two deadly hitmen sent to silence her, they board a Vancouver-bound train only to discover that the killers are onboard with them. For the next 20 hours, as the train hurls through the beautiful but isolated Canadian wilderness, a deadly game of cat and mouse ensues in which their ability to tell friend from foe is a matter of life and death.","releaseInfo":"1990","genres":["Action","Thriller","Crime","Mystery","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.4","runtime":"97 min","cast":["Gene Hackman","Anne Archer","James B. Sikking","Harris Yulin","J.T. Walsh","M. Emmet Walsh","Susan Hogan","Nigel Bennett"],"director":["Peter Hyams"],"released":"1990-09-21T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"It will take you to the edge of suspense.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Gene Hackman","character":"Robert Caulfield","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zDlv9vXjnRsvwNI0bARG0uOt5CJ.jpg"},{"name":"Anne Archer","character":"Carol Hunnicut","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/y1uFANprVvJ9cCqVKSl0umIpIXw.jpg"},{"name":"James B. Sikking","character":"Nelson","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vovQGuc3Lcw6h7xECd2OhBCx78q.jpg"},{"name":"Harris Yulin","character":"Leo Watts","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3W758yxhdphzblpgDz4wKgLCriB.jpg"},{"name":"J.T. Walsh","character":"Michael Tarlow","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mBa1UnbbKryNtQKT3VOnzER1HiQ.jpg"},{"name":"M. Emmet Walsh","character":"Sergeant Dominick Benti","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fVWvBxvwyk4aTA9vK